tentatively you four.

286
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,640
Yishan is the team leader.

287
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:23,480
You assist her.

288
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:25,120
I'm already halfway through this case.

289
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,200
Setting up a joint investigation team

290
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,240
all of a sudden...

291
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,120
What does this mean?

292
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:29,120
Prosecutor Qiao,

293
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:31,480
do you not trust my ability
to handle cases?

294
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:33,360
Are you here to question me?

295
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,650
I wouldn't dare.

296
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:37,680
I just want a clear explanation.

297
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:38,720
What nonsense are you talking about?

298
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,880
Who said anything about dying?

299
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:41,440
The office wants

300
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,640
to step up the efforts

301
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,000
and speed up the pace of this case.

302
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,400
It's also to protect you.

303
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:47,720
It's settled.

304
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,140
Get to work.

305
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:58,920
Ms. Xu,

306
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:00,610
do you also doubt

307
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,200
I can handle this case?

308
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:03,160
Wei,

309
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:04,120
this case

310
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,800
is more complicated than you think.

311
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:07,000
It's not that simple.

312
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:10,000
Was the joint investigation team
your idea too?

313
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:12,120
We all follow the office's arrangements.

314
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:12,450
Fine.

315
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:13,660
I respect that,

316
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,480
but I reserve my opinion.

317
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,690
Wei Feng's wife, Han Jiatong, is here.

318
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:23,740
Why is she here?

319
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,530
She says she wants to report Li Ran.

320
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:28,760
What a combo.

321
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:30,360
Let's go.

322
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:31,240
Wei,

323
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:33,620
let's go together.

324
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:37,800
Thank you.

325
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:45,920
I have evidence that Wei Feng
didn't sexually assault Li Ran.

326
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:46,840
Ms. Han,

327
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:48,620
I'm in charge of this case.

328
00:11:48,680 --> 00:11:49,810
My name is Xu Yishan.

329
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:01,090
Wei Feng's family is very rich.

330
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:02,120
I also know

331
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:04,500
he's always had a lot of women.

332
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:06,160
I just didn't expect

333
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:08,080
Ran to be one of them.

334
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:11,000
You didn't know about their affair before?

335
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:13,160
Ran and I are best friends.

336
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:15,880
I never thought she would betray me.

337
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:17,600
I only recently found out that

338
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:20,920
Wei Feng has been transferring money
to her under the guise of project bonuses.

339
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:21,360
And

340
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,240
it's a large sum.

341
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,800
Li Ran is an employee of Weihong Group.

342
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:27,060
Isn't it normal for her

343
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,400
to get project bonuses?

344
00:12:28,400 --> 00:12:30,600
Although the company has such a system,

345
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,480
Ran isn't in any projects.

346
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:33,840
Wei Feng

347
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:35,360
gave her all this money

348
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,520
on his own.

349
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:38,360
Does Wei Feng really need
to go through so much trouble

350
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:40,120
to transfer money to Li Ran?

351
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:42,930
Maybe he was considering my feelings.

352
00:12:43,280 --> 00:12:45,400
After all, he is my fiancé.

353
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:47,360
Then what kind of person

354
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:49,280
do you think your fiancé is?

355
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:54,720
He's just a kid.

356
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:57,000
He comes from a rich family

357
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,260
and is well protected.

358
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:01,180
But he only ever plays around.

359
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:03,160
He wouldn't dare do something like this.

360
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:03,890
First of all,

361
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,970
on behalf of Weihong Group,

362
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:08,520
I would like to thank you all for coming.

363
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:15,000
Weilai Fund

364
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,760
is a charity organization

365
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:19,360
established by Weihong Group
many years ago.

366
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:21,480
This organization

367
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:22,880
is now managed by my son,

368
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:23,760
Wei Feng,

369
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:25,490
as the general manager.

370
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:28,800
Come on,

371
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:29,330
Wei Feng,

372
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:30,120
and Li Ran.

373
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,500
Jiatong, you come too.

374
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,120
Let's go.

375
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:36,980
Stop dawdling.

376
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:42,690
Since he was a child,

377
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:43,560
Wei Feng

378
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,840
has joined me in many charity events.

379
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:46,520
Who is this woman?

380
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:48,000
Is she Chairman Wei's daughter-in-law?

381
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,240
Which of these two is his daughter-in-law?

382
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:50,840
Since Feng took office...

383
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:53,400
He actively participates in charity work

384
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:53,920
and

385
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:56,960
has gained wide support and recognition
from all sectors of society.

386
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:57,600
Let me

387
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:57,960
say a few words.

388
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:58,360
Here.

389
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:02,600
My friends from the press,

390
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:03,600
the person next to me

391
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:06,040
is Li Ran,
a student sponsored by our foundation.

392
00:14:06,040 --> 00:14:07,360
She has been an excellent student
with good character since childhood,

393
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:08,600
and she knows how to show gratitude.

394
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:09,460
Come here, Ran.

395
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:10,500
Say a few words.

396
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:14,640
I am

397
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:17,280
especially grateful to Chairman Wei
and the Weilai Foundation

398
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:18,940
for giving me the opportunity

399
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,090
and helping me grow.

400
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:21,680
When I was in high school,

401
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:23,760
my father died in a car accident.

402
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:24,680
My mother

403
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:27,170
was severely disabled as a result.

404
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,240
During my hardest times,

405
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:31,980
it was the Weilai Foundation
that helped me.

406
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,920
They not only supported me through college

407
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:36,450
but also provided me
with job opportunities.

408
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:37,440
In the future,

409
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:39,600
let us keep a grateful heart

410
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:42,450
and continue to stand by Weihong Group...

411
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:43,480
Keep walking.

412
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:01,800
Who told you to make a scene
at the Procuratorate?

413
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:03,530
Don't I have enough on my plate?

414
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:05,360
All you care about is money.

415
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:07,890
Do you know how miserable
your son is in there?

416
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,520
If I don't blow this up,

417
00:15:09,520 --> 00:15:10,440
will they even take it seriously?

418
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:11,300
Let me tell you,

419
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:13,120
doing this

420
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:14,880
will only make things worse.

421
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:15,360
You...

422
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:16,760
Chairman Wei,

423
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:18,620
please don't be too angry.

424
00:15:18,800 --> 00:15:20,400
Madam is just being a loving mother.

425
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:22,080
The most important thing right now

426
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:24,320
is that this has already
gone viral online.

427
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:25,320
Our PR response

428
00:15:25,760 --> 00:15:26,690
needs to keep up.

429
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:28,960
You can leave.

430
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:30,840
We're having a meeting.

431
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:32,640
Is there something I can't hear?

432
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:33,680
Why are you getting involved

433
00:15:33,680 --> 00:15:34,880
in company business?

434
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:35,560
Go, go, go.

435
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:38,680
Always doing things behind my back.

436
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:49,450
Jiatong,

437
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,960
the night Li Ran died,

438
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:53,480
Xiaofeng called you.

439
00:15:54,520 --> 00:15:55,240
Are you sure

440
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,920
he didn't sound unusual?

441
00:15:57,920 --> 00:16:00,050
I was about to watch a movie with my mom,

442
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:01,960
so we hung up after a few words.

443
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:04,660
If you ask if there was anything unusual,

444
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:07,760
I'm not 100% sure.

445
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:09,080
But...

446
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:10,330
But what?

447
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:13,040
I don't believe Xiaofeng
would kill anyone.

448
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:14,680
He must have been framed.

449
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:16,280
Mr. Qin,

450
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,840
based on your experience

451
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,320
and the evidence

452
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:22,640
the prosecutors have,

453
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:26,360
what will they finally
charge Xiaofeng with?

454
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:27,640
Rest assured, Chairman Wei.

455
00:16:27,640 --> 00:16:29,170
I've arranged everything.

456
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:31,120
Wei Jr. has also retracted his confession.

457
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:32,520
As long as he holds steady,

458
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:33,850
we can turn this around.

459
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:36,880
You know rape

460
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,900
isn't that easy to define.

461
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:40,880
I only care about the result.

462
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:44,720
Preferably an acquittal.
